Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Section: @SECTION@
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_KB@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Description: @SUMMARY@
 Tablinum is an offline Latin reading course that runs in the web browser
 already installed on the computer. Eight illustrated lessons with recorded
 sentences, exercises, word review and a glossary. Nothing is downloaded and
 no account is needed. Progress is kept in the browser of each user.
